{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：23:15 2026-11-15 HKT<br/>發佈時間：23:15 2026-11-15 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：23:15 2026-11-15 HKT</p><p>向海嵐今日（15日）到到灣仔出席頒獎禮活動，她最近參與演出HOY處境劇《你的保安 李寶安》，她指，是首次參演處境劇，直言與正劇分別大，其角色定位尖酸刻薄，被網民讚貼地，笑稱跟真實的她完全不一樣。</p><h2>向海嵐發掘另一面向</h2><p>至於演出獲正評，向海嵐稱開心，發掘了她的另一面，感謝網民喜歡其演繹方式；令觀眾的印象不再停留於《無頭東宮》。她補充，原定是客串演出，聽聞有關方面已在度期，或再度回歸劇組同大家見面。</p><img alt=\"向海嵐出席頒獎禮活動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/189087a7d62f92b8a1080adeb9609a85/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_17_23_41.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"向海嵐客串處境劇《你的保安 李寶安》，搣甩《無頭東宮》舊印象。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/2e815a41516151bbe547e0644570e930/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_17_23_50.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"向海嵐和Brian在劇中針鋒相對，火花四濺。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/1ecb328e3486b16569b7c437818e2755/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-05_at_00_32_11_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"二人爭些大打出手，身為保安的李尚正和曾睿智當然要上前幫手協調。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/9d8bd7c98fb510cfbf9aeb81b69c9d35/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-05_at_00_32_11_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"劇組為向海嵐補祝生日，令壽星女驚喜不已。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/6770f70a9355a0d865f3494c81a35daf/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-05_at_00_32_11_3_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"向海嵐首次跟Brian合作，驚訝他原來唔識睇中文。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/368b17c93533ca0f537057f4a66d4a4b/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-05_at_00_32_11_7_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"Brian的「邋遢」打扮和向海嵐斯文造型成強烈對比。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/b603e412b7eb374f799aa6ea6d9bb852/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-05_at_00_32_11.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T15:43:16.198443+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":281,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T15:15:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T19:40:20.948927+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T15:36:50.572587+00:00","content_hash":"e4b1753eefc7c8a1cdc1e1dcfe5e896fe22e8b88936575742c27b323c341629b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}